<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 4.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.49 pct vs	6.36 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.47 pct vs	7.34 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  102.80   vs    103.70</p>
<p> Bids		 5.968 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   4.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous auction was of a seventh tranche of the 10-year, 7.75 percent BTPs on December 17.</p>
</text>
